      "content": "thanks. i think i'll start with the ductwork since you mentioned leaks. if the ducts are tucked away inside the ceiling or behind a wall, is there a way to tell if they're leaking or disconnected without having to tear out all the drywall? like, are there any specific signs or sounds i should look for?",
